> Take the hoist passage to Hoist room   [success, watch 27]
  * A voice from low down in the dark: 'Here! Over here. Mind the fallen timber rack; it's on my leg. Don't just haul on it. Something cracked when it came down.'
> Lever the fallen timber rack up with a pry bar   [success, watch 28]
  "You get a pry bar under the fallen timber rack and lean on it. It lifts a hand's breadth, and Pell drags the leg clear: bruised and cut, but whole."
> Collect the bronze tram bearing for Bran   [success, watch 29]
  "Bran takes the bronze tram bearing."
  ~ Bran gains 1 the bronze tram bearing.
> Ask Pell to come with you   [success, watch 30]
  "Pell falls in beside you."
